hydrasynth-editor

The Hydrasynth SysEx protocol, patch format and corrected NRPN tables this
project builds on were reverse engineered by Sean Luke and contributors for
Edisyn (https://github.com/eclab/edisyn, edisyn/synth/asmhydrasynth/info/):

  Copyright 2023 by Sean Luke
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (full text in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt)
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

src/params/generated.ts is generated from that driver (its parameter layout,
ranges, display strings and NRPN encodings, extracted by running it;
tools/edisyn-extract/ names the exact commit).
src/params/fxPresets.generated.ts is generated from the same driver's source (its FX preset
names and values, tools/generateFxPresets.ts).

test/fixtures/sawexpressive.syx.hex is the "Sawpressive GD" dump from Edisyn's
Decode.java, converted to hex text.

public/waves/ holds Thierry Rochebois Zic's Hydrasynth wave images, CC BY 4.0, as cut and
colour-inverted by Sean Luke for Edisyn; see public/waves/README.txt.
src/ui/waveFeatures.generated.ts is measured from those images (tools/analyzeWaves.ts):
each wave's harmonic levels and roughness as the pictures show them.
public/waves-plain/ holds the same images with the wave's name removed (tools/stripWaveNames.ts),
CC BY 4.0 as well; the editor shows them only until public/wave-cycles.json has loaded.
public/wave-cycles.json holds one cycle per wave recorded from the synth's audio output
(tools/recordWaves.ts, tools/recordPhases.ts, tools/extractCycles.ts), drawn in the colours of those images: their
line colour and harmonic bars (CC BY 4.0).

